    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ever-growing settlement! Use the resources at your disposal to build  structures necessary for survival: housing, production, processing, and more. When resources grow scarce, explore your surroundings for more. Create sprawling settlements, organized central villages, or anything in between- whatever works to expand your domain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/71a78b2612e991cabaf4baf4ca906137.avif?t=1753363292\" width=350 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to build new structures and keep your settlers alive. Resource management is essential for a thriving settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/2ed683393108840cee6de82bc042761c.poster.avif?t=1753363292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/2ed683393108840cee6de82bc042761c.webm?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/2ed683393108840cee6de82bc042761c.mp4?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/b9bb2a63bc295045f5986cbff0ba430f.avif?t=1753363292\" width=350 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new structures! There are 5 main types: housing, production, exploration, services, and processing. Placement is key for survival- can you maximize efficiency and still keep your settlement looking pretty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/bff8d3605637929542c7d4374e323ab7.poster.avif?t=1753363292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/bff8d3605637929542c7d4374e323ab7.webm?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/bff8d3605637929542c7d4374e323ab7.mp4?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/0879323b1895e56ae1d12680bce42361.avif?t=1753363292\" width=350 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear away the unknown to discover more resources and fresh landscapes in a limitless procedural world that grows with your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/1acfe28a94e179f4d33fcb47e345b94b.poster.avif?t=1753363292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/1acfe28a94e179f4d33fcb47e345b94b.webm?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/1acfe28a94e179f4d33fcb47e345b94b.mp4?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/5f0fba784d286d95d96dc3e3778afe0a.avif?t=1753363292\" width=350 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Influence to recruit new settlers to your cause. Larger populations can produce more resources, but need more food and housing to survive!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/315e4b94fdc1005545de2013fe35493e.poster.avif?t=1753363292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/315e4b94fdc1005545de2013fe35493e.webm?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396920/extras/315e4b94fdc1005545de2013fe35493e.mp4?t=1753363292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
